   I didn't keep optional things in mind. However, since people will want to use Lojbanized names with irregular stress, and talk about {selma'o}, an alternate character set analogous to capitals will be needed. As for the comma syllable 
separator, I've never seen it used and it seems utterly unnecessary to me. These could be expansion projects but not very high priority personally.
   By the way, I'm currently working on arranging a MessyBoard (www.messyboard.org) for Lojbanists to use on things like this.
